<title>BRAZIL: Bovespa sees 315.3 mln-real inflow in Oct.</title>
<headline>Bovespa sees 315.3 mln-real inflow in Oct.</headline>
<dateline>SAO PAULO 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Sao Paulo Stock Exchange (Bovespa) said it registered net foreign capital inflows of 315.3 million reais in October.</p>
<p>Foreign buys amounted to 3.187 billion reais versus foreign sells of 2.871 billion reais, it said.</p>
<p>In September, the Bovespa saw net capital inflows of 450.9 million reais, it said.</p>
<p>So far this year, net foreign capital inflows have totalled 2.346 billion reais, it said.</p>
<p>-- Romina Nicaretta, Sao Paulo newsroom, 5511 232 4411.</p>
